---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /uslugi/
title: Услуги
description: PVC и алуминиева дограма, врати, щори, комарници, обръщане с PVC профили и още услуги от ДМД Комфорт.
---
{% from "macros/page-banner.njk" import pageBanner %}

{% call pageBanner() %}
  <div class="eyebrow text-brand before:bg-brand">Каталог услуги</div>
  <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,3.75rem)] font-black leading-none">Всички услуги</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">От дограма и щори до обръщане с PVC профили — пълни решения за комфорт.</p>
{% endcall %}

<section class="section-pad bg-brand-mist">
  <div class="container-site grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {% for s in services %}
      <article class="card reveal flex flex-col">
        <div class="relative m-3 aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
          <img class="image-cover" src="{{ s.image | url }}" alt="{{ s.title }}" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col border-t border-ink/10 px-5 pb-6 pt-4">
          <h2 class="mb-2 font-display text-[22px] font-extrabold">{{ s.title }}</h2>
          <p class="mb-5 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">{{ s.shortDescription }}</p>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="{{ ('/uslugi/' + s.slug + '/') | url }}">Разгледай
            <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
